{"id":"0c5a5b5ff728bc74","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-first-order-formula-vocabulary.md","title":"一阶公式的非逻辑语汇与自由参数","display":"df-first-order-formula-vocabulary — 一阶公式的非逻辑语汇与自由参数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-first-order-formula-vocabulary","aliases":["72-df-first-order-formula-vocabulary"],"display":"df-first-order-formula-vocabulary — 一阶公式的非逻辑语汇与自由参数","depends_on":["[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]"],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §2.5.5 notation L(A), print56/PDF68","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"source vocabulary convention and structural recursion checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-first-order-formula-vocabulary"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-first-order-formula-vocabulary</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-first-order-formula-vocabulary — 一阶公式的非逻辑语汇与自由参数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §2.5.5 notation L(A), print56/PDF68"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"source vocabulary convention and structural recursion checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Σ、项、扩充公式、自由变量取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a>，Σ 的常元、函数、关系集合分别为 C、F、R。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in C\">\\(c\\in C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in F\">\\(f\\in F\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in R\">\\(P\\in R\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}\">\\(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{nl}_t,\\operatorname{nl}\">\\(\\operatorname{nl}_t,\\operatorname{nl}\\)</span> 分别按严格子项、子公式递归；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{voc}\">\\(\\operatorname{voc}\\)</span> 还包含自由变量，绑定变量不记入语汇。Γ 为有限公式序列。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{nl}_t(x)&amp;:=\\varnothing,\\quad\\operatorname{nl}_t(c):=\\{c\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{nl}_t(f(\\vec t)):=\\{f\\}\\cup\\bigcup_i\\operatorname{nl}_t(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{nl}(t\\doteq u)&amp;:=\\operatorname{nl}_t(t)\\cup\\operatorname{nl}_t(u),\\quad\n\\operatorname{nl}(P(\\vec t)):=\\{P\\}\\cup\\bigcup_i\\operatorname{nl}_t(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{nl}(\\top)&amp;:=\\operatorname{nl}(\\bot):=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{nl}(\\neg A):=\\operatorname{nl}(A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{nl}(A\\circ B)&amp;:=\\operatorname{nl}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{nl}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{nl}(QxA):=\\operatorname{nl}(A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{voc}(A)&amp;:=\\operatorname{nl}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{voc}(\\Gamma):=\\bigcup_{i&lt;|\\Gamma|}\\operatorname{voc}(\\Gamma_i).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{nl}_t(x)&amp;:=\\varnothing,\\quad\\operatorname{nl}_t(c):=\\{c\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{nl}_t(f(\\vec t)):=\\{f\\}\\cup\\bigcup_i\\operatorname{nl}_t(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{nl}(t\\doteq u)&amp;:=\\operatorname{nl}_t(t)\\cup\\operatorname{nl}_t(u),\\quad\n\\operatorname{nl}(P(\\vec t)):=\\{P\\}\\cup\\bigcup_i\\operatorname{nl}_t(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{nl}(\\top)&amp;:=\\operatorname{nl}(\\bot):=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{nl}(\\neg A):=\\operatorname{nl}(A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{nl}(A\\circ B)&amp;:=\\operatorname{nl}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{nl}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{nl}(QxA):=\\operatorname{nl}(A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{voc}(A)&amp;:=\\operatorname{nl}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{voc}(\\Gamma):=\\bigcup_{i&lt;|\\Gamma|}\\operatorname{voc}(\\Gamma_i).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>等号按逻辑身份符号处理，不计入非逻辑集合；常元即使位于被量化原子中仍计入，而量词自身不增加非逻辑符号。书中 L(A) 同时记自由变量，本节点用 voc 精确对应，以免将命题变量集 Var 当作一阶语汇。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"Σ、项、扩充公式、自由变量取 [[72-df-calculus-syntax]]，Σ 的常元、函数、关系集合分别为 C、F、R。$c\\in C$，$f\\in F$，$P\\in R$；$\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}$、$Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"c\\in C","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in F","display":false},{"tex":"P\\in R","display":false},{"tex":"\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{nl}_t,\\operatorname{nl}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{voc}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{nl}_t(x)&:=\\varnothing,\\quad\\operatorname{nl}_t(c):=\\{c\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{nl}_t(f(\\vec t)):=\\{f\\}\\cup\\bigcup_i\\operatorname{nl}_t(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{nl}(t\\doteq u)&:=\\operatorname{nl}_t(t)\\cup\\operatorname{nl}_t(u),\\quad\n\\operatorname{nl}(P(\\vec t)):=\\{P\\}\\cup\\bigcup_i\\operatorname{nl}_t(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{nl}(\\top)&:=\\operatorname{nl}(\\bot):=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{nl}(\\neg A):=\\operatorname{nl}(A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{nl}(A\\circ B)&:=\\operatorname{nl}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{nl}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{nl}(QxA):=\\operatorname{nl}(A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{voc}(A)&:=\\operatorname{nl}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{voc}(\\Gamma):=\\bigcup_{i<|\\Gamma|}\\operatorname{voc}(\\Gamma_i).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2323,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-103","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增5项：[[72-df-first-order-craig-interpolant]] · [[72-df-first-order-formula-vocabulary]] · [[72-ex-forall-eigenvariable-countermodel]] · [[72-thm-first-order-craig-interpolation]] · [[72-thm-partitioned-sequent-interpolation]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-477","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增5项：[[72-df-first-order-craig-interpolant]] · [[72-df-first-order-formula-vocabulary]] · [[72-ex-forall-eigenvariable-countermodel]] · [[72-thm-first-order-craig-interpolation]] · [[72-thm-partitioned-sequent-interpolation]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-472","locations":["正文"],"count":